Z||000000||Greg Piet||06-27-2000||05:41 PM||||OK I was visiting a friend in Oakland New jersey, and while it was parked outside his house on Sunday between 6:30 and 9:30 PM somebody smacked my car and tore up my rear driver side 1/4 panel.  So I need to replace the "rear roof panel". <P>The vehicle was most likely a SUV.   If anybody by some odd chance knows who committed this heinous act plase inform the oakland police.  <BR>I have most of their passenger side front turn signal lens, and it looks like pieces of their plastic headlight lens.  They also took a big chunk of the fiberglass of my car.<P>With the car in its current condition I dont think I will be able to attend my next autocross race which angers me even more!<P>GEESH I think a hit and run is weak!<P>Thanks all for your time||||reg||1
